{"id":"ac978c566ec8e658","group":"58","path":"58/batch08/58-df-p-group.md","title":"p-group","display":"df-p-group — p-group","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-p-group","aliases":["58-df-p-group"],"display":"df-p-group — p-group","depends_on":["[[../batch09/58-df-group.md]]","[[../batch19/58-df-prime-number.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-p-group"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-p-group</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-p-group — p-group"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"ed71f39f59370734\" href=\"?note=ed71f39f59370734\" title=\"../batch09/58-df-group.md\">../batch09/58-df-group.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"dad686059f3ca152\" href=\"?note=dad686059f3ca152\" title=\"../batch19/58-df-prime-number.md\">../batch19/58-df-prime-number.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G,\\cdot,p\\in V\">\\(G,\\cdot,p\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Group}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{Group}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span> (group predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"ed71f39f59370734\" href=\"?note=ed71f39f59370734\" title=\"../batch09/58-df-group.md\">../batch09/58-df-group.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Prime}\\subseteq\\omega\">\\(\\operatorname{Prime}\\subseteq\\omega\\)</span> (prime predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"dad686059f3ca152\" href=\"?note=dad686059f3ca152\" title=\"../batch19/58-df-prime-number.md\">../batch19/58-df-prime-number.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PGroupStructure}_S\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{PGroupStructure}_S\\subseteq V^3\\)</span> (p-group-structure predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}p\\text{-}group}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{PGroupStructure}_S(G,\\cdot,p)\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\\mathrm{Group}_S(G,\\cdot)\\land\\operatorname{Prime}(p)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\exists e\\in G\\;\\Bigl(\n\\forall x\\in G\\;(e\\cdot x=x\\land x\\cdot e=x)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{6.1em}\\land\\forall g\\in G\\;\\exists n\\in\\omega\\;(g^{p^n}=e)\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}p\\text{-}group}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{PGroupStructure}_S(G,\\cdot,p)\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\\mathrm{Group}_S(G,\\cdot)\\land\\operatorname{Prime}(p)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\exists e\\in G\\;\\Bigl(\n\\forall x\\in G\\;(e\\cdot x=x\\land x\\cdot e=x)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{6.1em}\\land\\forall g\\in G\\;\\exists n\\in\\omega\\;(g^{p^n}=e)\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The operation and its identity are explicit data rather than hidden ambient parameters.</li>\n<li>Finite p-groups have cardinality a power of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\">\\(p\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch09/58-df-group.md","status":"resolved","id":"ed71f39f59370734","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch09/58-df-group.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch19/58-df-prime-number.md","status":"resolved","id":"dad686059f3ca152","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch19/58-df-prime-number.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch09/58-df-group.md","status":"resolved","id":"ed71f39f59370734","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Group}_S\\subseteq V^2$ (group predicate, see [[../batch09/58-df-group.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch19/58-df-prime-number.md","status":"resolved","id":"dad686059f3ca152","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Prime}\\subseteq\\omega$ (prime predicate, see [[../batch19/58-df-prime-number.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"G,\\cdot,p\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Group}_S\\subseteq V^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Prime}\\subseteq\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PGroupStructure}_S\\subseteq V^3","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}p\\text{-}group}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{PGroupStructure}_S(G,\\cdot,p)\n\\leftrightarrow{}&\\mathrm{Group}_S(G,\\cdot)\\land\\operatorname{Prime}(p)\\\\\n&\\land\\exists e\\in G\\;\\Bigl(\n\\forall x\\in G\\;(e\\cdot x=x\\land x\\cdot e=x)\\\\\n&\\hspace{6.1em}\\land\\forall g\\in G\\;\\exists n\\in\\omega\\;(g^{p^n}=e)\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"p","display":false}],"bytes":1084,"backlinks":[{"id":"6007c8bd31b5cfde","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"b2cc87480438176a","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"b4756908c8b755cf","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"0d8f17dcaa965ccb","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-932","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch08/58-df-p-group.md|58-df-p-group]]（batch08）"}],"outgoing":["ed71f39f59370734","dad686059f3ca152"]}